
// The charname returns to the inn without Ekilis.
@1=~Protector, you have finally returned. Thanks to you, the temple door is open again.~
@2=~Who are you?~ 
@3=~I did nothing; it opened by itself before me.~
@4=~I am Candelas, Grand Inquisitor of the god of gods, Cyric.~
@5=~I wish I could have seen this with my own eyes.~ 
@6=~Upon Bhaal's death, many of his servants rallied to Cyric, and we learned of the existence of this temple. Ekilis's mission was to destroy it.~
@7=~Thanks to his stupidity, the temple remained sealed for many years, waiting for a child of Bhaal to appear at its door.~
@8=~I was about to use Sarevok when you killed him. Imagine my disappointment when I learned of his death...~
@9=~I assumed you were also a child of Bhaal. So I used Barni to lure you here, and I'm not disappointed with the result.~ 
@10=~There you have it, Protector, I've told you my story. Now it's your turn. Tell me about this temple.~
@11=~(You grant Candelas's request)~
@12=~I see, you're afraid of being imprisoned yourself, and you have good reason. This temple is a death trap for Cyric's followers. (mocking tone)~
@13=~Cyric is truly surrounded by idiots. It's urgent that we clean house!~ 
@14=~Thank you for bringing me here. But I have another idea in mind. You're going to taste the CHAMPION OF BHAAL!~
@15=~(no response, then attack)~
@16=~Excellent, I can't wait to get in. All I have to do now is get rid of you.~
@17=~I wanted to return the favor. No more playing around! Attack!~ 
@18=~Cyric is really surrounded by idiots. It's time to clean house!~
@19=~Thank you for bringing me here. But I have another idea in mind. You're going to get a taste of BHAAL'S CHAMPION!~ 
@20=~(don't reply and attack)~
@21=~As you wish. I'll find out for myself. Let's finish this!~ 
// The charname returns to the inn with Ekilis 
@100=~So you're finally back, and with Ekilis, whom we thought was lost.~
@101=~I should have known you'd take advantage of the situation...~
@102=~May we know who you are?~ 
@103=~I'm not stupid! I am Ekilis, Cyric's Grand Inquisitor, and you must treat me with respect!~ 
@104=~Things have changed a lot in your absence, my dear Ekilis. We will settle this matter after we get rid of Bhaal's child.~ 
@105=~I will offer his heart to Cyric's glory, and then you will be punished for your disrespect!~
I'll 
